ake the educator expense deduction, and for other… (HR 5334) — Passed, Sep 16, 2026 · 6:28 PM ET\n* House roll call 307: Directing the President, pursuant to section 5(c) of the War Powers Resolution, to remove United States Armed Forces from hostilities with… (HCONRES 93) — Passed, Sep 15, 2026 · 10:32 PM ET\n\nAll House votes\n\n## Recent stock trades disclosed by members of Congress\n\nAmounts are the ranges reported on each filing, not exact values.\n\n| Member | Type | Asset | Amount (as filed) | Trade date | Filed |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Suzan K. DelBene (D-WA) | purchase | Black Belt Energy Gas Dist Ala Gas 05.00% 12/01/2035 Proj… | $250,001 - $500,000 | 10/14/2026 | 10/28/2026 |\n| Suzan K. DelBene (D-WA) | sale | Tennessee Energy Ac 5% Edr Idr Due 12/01/35 | $250,001 - $500,000 | 10/14/2026 | 10/28/2026 |\n| Pete Sessions (R-TX) | sale | Apple Inc. - Common Stock (AAPL) (AAPL) | $250,001 - $500,000 | 10/02/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Pete Sessions (R-TX) | sale | Costco Wholesale Corporation - Common Stock (COST) (COST) | $250,001 - $500,000 | 10/02/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Pete Sessions (R-TX) | sale | Microsoft Corporation - Common Stock (MSFT) (MSFT) | $250,001 - $500,000 | 10/02/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Pete Sessions (R-TX) | sale | Alphabet Inc. - Class C Capital Stock (GOOG) (GOOG) | $100,001 - $250,000 | 10/02/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Pete Sessions (R-TX) | sale | Amazon.com, Inc. - Common Stock (AMZN) (AMZN) | $100,001 - $250,000 | 10/02/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Pete Sessions (R-TX) | sale | Costco Wholesale Corporation - Common Stock (COST) (COST) | $100,001 - $250,000 | 10/13/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Diana Harshbarger (R-TN) | sale | US TSY Note 4/ Due 5/31/28 | $100,001 - $250,000 | 09/14/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Diana Harshbarger (R-TN) | purchase | Iiinois ST TOLL HWY U RV BE/RY | $50,001 - $100,000 | 09/22/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Diana Harshbarger (R-TN) | sale | New York NY SR G BE/R | $50,001 - $100,000 | 10/02/2026 | 10/27/2026 |\n| Diana